      "writtenOn": "2026-08-20T14:03:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Assuming Blink will instantiate `SkIcoRustCodec` directly (which I think it will), we could also introduce specialized APIs to query the embedded image registry.\n\n`SkIcoRustCodec::MakeFromStream` currently returns an `SkCodec`, but it could be updated to return the concrete type for access to these APIs.",
      "parentUuid": "897a5009_5d75288a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 421,
        "startChar": 7,
        "endLine": 421,
        "endChar": 30
      },
      "revId": "64e3c0fbac0667fdcc2905eabb9414cf779b83c8",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
