      "writtenOn": "2026-08-24T11:36:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done. ICO entries are no longer exposed as SkCodec animation frames. I also added the small Skia API needed by the follow-up Chromium change: MakeFromStream() returns the concrete SkIcoRustCodec, which exposes the embedded image count and dimensions. Blink can use this to preserve size selection through an ICO-specific adapter.",
